        Product images.

        Real photography for the Tfole player line and the activity kit;
        brand-coloured placeholder tiles for everything else until photos
        exist. Not noupdate, so swapping a file and running make upgrade wins.

        The six story card packs all point at the same group shot, because
        that is the only card photograph there is. Individual card fronts
        would be better.
    -->

